{"status":"ready","content":"Let the data set be $S = \\{25, 10, 0, 9, -1, -14, -21\\}$.\r\nThe number of elements in $S$ is $n = 7$.\r\nThe sample mean $\\overline{x}$ is\r\n$$ \\overline{x} = \\frac{25+10+0+9+(-1)+(-14)+(-21)}{7} = \\frac{25+10+9-1-14-21}{7} = \\frac{39-36}{7} = \\frac{3}{7} $$\r\nWe compute the squared differences from the mean:\r\n\\begin{align*} (25-\\frac{3}{7})^2 &= (\\frac{175-3}{7})^2 = (\\frac{172}{7})^2 = \\frac{29584}{49} \\\\ (10-\\frac{3}{7})^2 &= (\\frac{70-3}{7})^2 = (\\frac{67}{7})^2 = \\frac{4489}{49} \\\\ (0-\\frac{3}{7})^2 &= (-\\frac{3}{7})^2 = \\frac{9}{49} \\\\ (9-\\frac{3}{7})^2 &= (\\frac{63-3}{7})^2 = (\\frac{60}{7})^2 = \\frac{3600}{49} \\\\ (-1-\\frac{3}{7})^2 &= (-\\frac{7+3}{7})^2 = (-\\frac{10}{7})^2 = \\frac{100}{49} \\\\ (-14-\\frac{3}{7})^2 &= (-\\frac{98+3}{7})^2 = (-\\frac{101}{7})^2 = \\frac{10201}{49} \\\\ (-21-\\frac{3}{7})^2 &= (-\\frac{147+3}{7})^2 = (-\\frac{150}{7})^2 = \\frac{22500}{49} \\end{align*} \r\nThe sum of these squared differences is\r\n$$ \\frac{29584+4489+9+3600+100+10201+22500}{49} = \\frac{70483}{49} $$\r\nThe sample variance $s^2$ is\r\n$$ s^2 = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^n (x_i - \\overline{x})^2}{n-1} = \\frac{70483/49}{7-1} = \\frac{70483/49}{6} = \\frac{70483}{49 \\cdot 6} = \\frac{70483}{294} $$\r\nThe sample standard deviation $s$ is\r\n$$ s = \\sqrt{s^2} = \\sqrt{\\frac{70483}{294}} \\approx \\sqrt{239.738} \\approx 15.4835 $$\r\n\r\nThe squared differences are\r\n\\begin{align*} (25-3/7)^2 &= (\\frac{172}{7})^2 \\approx 599.673 \\\\ (10-3/7)^2 &= (\\frac{67}{7})^2 \\approx 91.612 \\\\ (0-3/7)^2 &= (\\frac{-3}{7})^2 \\approx 0.183 \\\\ (9-3/7)^2 &= (\\frac{60}{7})^2 \\approx 81.633 \\\\ (-1-3/7)^2 &= (\\frac{-10}{7})^2 \\approx 2.041 \\\\ (-14-3/7)^2 &= (\\frac{-101}{7})^2 \\approx 208.163 \\\\ (-21-3/7)^2 &= (\\frac{-150}{7})^2 \\approx 469.388 \\end{align*} \r\nSum is approximately $1452.69$\r\nSo $\\frac{1452.69}{6} \\approx 242.115$ so $s \\approx 15.56$\r\n\r\n$$ \\frac{70483}{49(6)} = \\frac{70483}{294} \\approx 239.738 $$\r\n$$ \\sqrt{239.738} \\approx 15.4835 $$\r\n\r\nFinal Answer: The final answer is $\\boxed{15.48}$\r\n","path":"responses/gemini-2-0-flash-lite/livebench-065-math.txt","size":1966,"mtime":1779367977}